  "description": "Contracts for TechTeaStudio.Billing: IBillingProvider, IBillingService, IBillingPaymentStore, IBillingFulfillment, IExternalPurchaseService, the attribution stores, the payment/notification models, ClaimCode and BillingPlanGuard. No dependencies and no ASP.NET Core framework reference, so domain and application assemblies can implement the seams without taking on the web stack. Referenced automatically by TechTeaStudio.Billing.",
